+ * Jadard JD9365 MIPI-DSI panel controller.
+ *
+ * The register sequence below is the vendor initialisation table for the
+ * Waveshare 10.1-DSI-TOUCH-A (800x1280, 2 lanes), transcribed from
+ * Espressif's esp_lcd_jd9365 component as republished by Waveshare in
+ * waveshareteam/Waveshare-ESP32-components. It is panel-specific rather
+ * than controller-specific: another JD9365 module wants its own table from
+ * its own supplier, which is why the whole thing is one contiguous block
+ * that is easy to swap out.
+ */
